better-screenshot (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release, forked from GNOME Screenshot 41.0.
  * Capture a single monitor, chosen from a drop-down and remembered
    between runs by connector name.
  * Save straight to the pictures directory with no preview dialog.
  * New --monitor option taking a monitor number or a connector name.
  * New desktop portal backend, used under Wayland.

